{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S11—S12等短时段里话句切分较多，感受信息也比较密集，Y的完整叙述读起来更顺畅。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点词加亮让人扫屏时能迅速抓住人物当下的处境和心理转折，话与感受交替也让叙事和音乐体验互相补充。尤其感受文字按音乐段落出现，既能呈现情绪从焦躁、怀念、失落到逐渐坚定的细微变化，也能让人感受到前后音乐主题与人物经历之间的联系。Y的叙述本身更连贯，但右侧感受词集中堆叠，部分短时段很难兼顾阅读、理解和听音乐。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e1318c22-097d-41a7-93c0-7e542ed046f2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T001435169749Z", "elapsed_seconds": 39.735, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:15:14.922814+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1d5ffdfab8355affc6cdfc7e0a1c7f4282285294b265d40a8e94d327ee58a6cd", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2388